          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mimi ndairiphiza Babeli na nyo asagalao kuko mbere za matso genu kpwa uyi ariouhenda ko Sayuni, Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhu ndio ujumbe uriolaviwa ni nabii Jeremia kpwa Seraya mwana wa Neriya, mwana wa Mahiseya, ariphophiya na Zedekiya, mfalume wa Juda ko Babeli mwaka wa ne wa utawalawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeremia kala akaandika chitabuni mai gosi ndigophaha Babeli, piya maneno ganjina kuhusu Babeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.60"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "61",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:61"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "61",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi Jeremia wamuamba Seraya: “Ndiphofika Babeli, henda chadi uasomere maneno higa kpwa sauti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.61",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.61"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "62",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:62"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "62",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chisha uambe, ‘Uwe Mwenyezi Mlungu waamba undaangamiza phatu hipha, ili mwanadamu wala nyama asiphasagale, mana phandakala gandzo hata kare na kare.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.62"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "63",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:63"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Maono 18:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndiphomala kusoma chitabu chichi, chifunge dziwe uchitsuphe muho wa Yufurati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.63",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.63"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "64",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:64"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "64",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha uambe, ‘Babeli indazama dza vivyo nayo taindaunuka tsona kpwa sababu ya mashaka ambago ndairehera phamwenga na atue.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.64",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.64"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "64",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:64"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "64",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ujumbe wa Jeremia uchisirira phapho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.64",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.64"
            ]
          }
        }
